WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.680
You made it to the end, and you are early.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:03.760
That is rare.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.860
Becoming a Founder takes a few quick questions,

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:12.340
about two minutes, and you are in, free, with 250 points to use across the

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:12.920
platform.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.160
Join before midnight Eastern on January 1,

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.460
2027, and Founding Member stays on your profile for good.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.400
Founders unlock some really cool things in 2027,

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.040
and the only way to hear about them, and lock them in for yourself,

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.040
is to join today.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.660
Once you are in, start simple:

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.640
vote for three places you love, check in when you visit a Vegan place,

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.940
and tell us one thing.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.000
Then pick your path.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:40.700
We want to hear from you.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.460
As a member, you shape what Vegans Explore becomes,

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.200
so let us know if something needs to be fixed.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.780
Membership is free.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.920
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.280
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.200
Bring people with you:

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:01.360
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.860
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:09.300
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:09.860
community.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.160
Become a Founder today.

